abstract: "Data, code and results for the reported analyses that do not require licensed or identifier-linked inputs, from a study of mention-level evaluation of SNOMED CT concept normalization on three Spanish clinical benchmarks: per-mention scores of five systems, credit gaps, error incidence and its decomposition, resampling intervals, relation types, label re-annotation and validation, alternative codes, cross-checks, Thai term-level, translation-by-normalization, Spanish lexical-resource and terminology-release analyses. Reported values that need such inputs are listed in README.md."
